==Battleground==
*100 [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
'''Don't kill the Metal Hippoes!''' Like the stage's predecessor, the enemy limit is 3: killing any of the Metal Hippoes will make room for the Assassin Bears to spawn. You'll want to use units with [[Knockback]] to send the enemies behind the base in order to destroy it without spawning any of the Assassin Bears.

Spam [[Bronze Cat (Rare Cat)|Quizmaster Cat]] to knock the Metal Hippoes back. While Michelangelo Cat has more knockbacks on average, their standing range does not exceed Metal Hippoe's 160. [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]] or [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future Cat]] should be your sole meatshield, as the Metal Hippoes here only have 800 HP. Bring anything else, preferably [[Long Distance]] units like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], to destroy the base once the Metal Hippoes are behind it without killing any of them.

